  "student": {
    "stem": "（2024秋·仁寿县校级期末）方程组 $\\begin{cases}x+y=0,\\\\x^2-4=0\\end{cases}$ 的解组成的集合为 ______。",
    "options": [],
    "parts": [],
    "assets": []
  },
  "teacher": {
    "answers": [
      {
        "partId": "main",
        "text": "$\\{(-2,2),(2,-2)\\}$",
        "provenance": "source",
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
            "sourceId": "set-teacher",
            "pages": [
              14
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "solutions": [
      {
        "partId": "main",
        "text": "由 $x^2-4=(x-2)(x+2)=0$ 得 x=−2 或 x=2。由 x+y=0 得 y=−x，分别得到 (x,y)=(−2,2) 或 (2,−2)。方程组的解是有序数对，故其解集为 $\\{(-2,2),(2,-2)\\}$，不能把所有坐标拆成无序数集。",
        "provenance": "source_adapted",
        "sourceRefs": [
          {
